<title>FRANCE: Cie des Signaux 96 turnover rose 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Cie des Signaux 96 turnover rose 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 1,939    vs    1,727</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the figures in a statement. At comparable structure and exchange rates, turnover rose six percent between 1996 and 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
